# Environment Variables

## Clerk Authentication (Optional - uncomment when ready to use)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=your_clerk_publishable_key_here
# CLERK_SECRET_KEY=your_clerk_secret_key_here

## Database
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://username:password@localhost:5432/database_name?schema=public"

## App Configuration
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://localhost:3000

## Instructions
# 1. Copy this file to .env (do not commit .env to git)
# 2. Fill in your actual credentials
# 3. To enable Clerk authentication:
#    - Uncomment the Clerk variables above
#    - Add ClerkProvider to src/app/layout.tsx
#    - Import: import { ClerkProvider } from "@clerk/nextjs";
#    - Wrap: <ClerkProvider><html>...</html></ClerkProvider>
